  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5602.03 Counter Service. The Department will accept requests for information at its counters and will process requests as soon as possible.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #13152 EXEMPT, eff 12-31-20",
